		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  comment uniformiser les variables locales]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=12919#p12919"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Vous pouvez essayer en ajoutant la commande TEMPLATE = template0 comme indiqué dans le message d&#039;erreur :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>CREATE DATABASE mabd
  WITH OWNER = tc
       ENCODING = &#039;UTF8&#039;
       TABLESPACE = pg_default
       LC_COLLATE = &#039;en_US.UTF-8&#039;
       LC_CTYPE = &#039;en_US.UTF-8&#039;
       TEMPLATE = template0</code></pre></div>]]></content>
